LegacyDroid
===========

Fork-based customization of LineageOS 18.1 for the x86_64 emulator target.

Getting started
---------------

```
repo init -u https://github.com/LegacyDroid/android_manifest.git -b lineage-18.1 --depth=1 --no-tags --git-lfs
repo sync --no-clone-bundle -j4
source build/envsetup.sh
lunch lineage_x86_64-userdebug
mka
```
